      "fieldId": "5a000023-0000-4000-a000-000000000023",
      "value": "- Keep the UUID-keyed FieldValue array.\n- Key the object by field UUID.\n- Transform authored names to lowerCamelCase.\n- Add a separate fieldId map to each Type.",
